{"3806150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exploding Judo Federation", "steam_appid": 3806150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4043840], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tech the grab or die trying!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of Schwarzerblitz and Motionsickness, here comes a new, fast paced, explosive, 1v1 fighting game, where <strong>every grab is lethal</strong>. Roll around, wait for an opening and smash your opponent on the tarmac (explosions might ensue)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/3a192a52e845462ec9cbb6f5314225b7.poster.avif?t=1777065597\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/3a192a52e845462ec9cbb6f5314225b7.webm?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/3a192a52e845462ec9cbb6f5314225b7.mp4?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's judo until it isn't</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grabs are the way, but this doesn't mean one cannot fight dirty! Each character has a super move at their disposal, be it an invincible grab, a counter attack or a full screen pew pew laser, that immediately seals the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/16cea2109af24cc51981086aa388262c.poster.avif?t=1777065597\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/16cea2109af24cc51981086aa388262c.webm?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/16cea2109af24cc51981086aa388262c.mp4?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strive for victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strikes to create grab opportunities, roll around the stage to position yourself, grab at the right moment to seal the deal. <strong>No block, no rest, only movement, fundamentals and a generous amount of dirt. </strong>Do you have what it takes to become the master of Exploding Judo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/63c70168b623446ee8f1212f0f09aa6d.poster.avif?t=1777065597\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/63c70168b623446ee8f1212f0f09aa6d.webm?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/63c70168b623446ee8f1212f0f09aa6d.mp4?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All of this with the help of...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >full 3D movement with the help of a Roll button. This is a five buttons game (punch, kick, grab, dash, roll) with emphasis on dodging and grabbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 standard characters plus 3 unlockable boss characters and an annoying gun-headed goon that cannot beat the champ even if he tries his best (well, unless he gets really, REALLY lucky with a random grab)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arcade mode, survival mode and time attack mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ten stages plus the classic grid (duh) and an extra <strong>green screen stage for photobashing shenanigans</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >local versus (online modes unfortunately not planned)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tutorial and training mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a psychopathic dabbing killer robot reinstalled into a bunny droid body (which is actually canon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a giant kaiju robot with plasma chainsaws and a full screen laser</strong> (which is ALSO canon, if you care about this sort of stuff)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the one and only <strong>Callowman from</strong> <strong>Duels of Fortune</strong> as a special playable guest character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and also <strong>Dana Zane from the visual novel VA-11 Hall-A</strong>, ready to mix drinks and smash lives!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tech the grab or die trying!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of Schwarzerblitz and Motionsickness, here comes a new, fast paced, explosive, 1v1 fighting game, where <strong>every grab is lethal</strong>. Roll around, wait for an opening and smash your opponent on the tarmac (explosions might ensue)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/3a192a52e845462ec9cbb6f5314225b7.poster.avif?t=1777065597\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/3a192a52e845462ec9cbb6f5314225b7.webm?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/3a192a52e845462ec9cbb6f5314225b7.mp4?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's judo until it isn't</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grabs are the way, but this doesn't mean one cannot fight dirty! Each character has a super move at their disposal, be it an invincible grab, a counter attack or a full screen pew pew laser, that immediately seals the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/16cea2109af24cc51981086aa388262c.poster.avif?t=1777065597\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/16cea2109af24cc51981086aa388262c.webm?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/16cea2109af24cc51981086aa388262c.mp4?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strive for victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strikes to create grab opportunities, roll around the stage to position yourself, grab at the right moment to seal the deal. <strong>No block, no rest, only movement, fundamentals and a generous amount of dirt. </strong>Do you have what it takes to become the master of Exploding Judo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/63c70168b623446ee8f1212f0f09aa6d.poster.avif?t=1777065597\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/63c70168b623446ee8f1212f0f09aa6d.webm?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/63c70168b623446ee8f1212f0f09aa6d.mp4?t=1777065597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All of this with the help of...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >full 3D movement with the help of a Roll button. This is a five buttons game (punch, kick, grab, dash, roll) with emphasis on dodging and grabbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 standard characters plus 3 unlockable boss characters and an annoying gun-headed goon that cannot beat the champ even if he tries his best (well, unless he gets really, REALLY lucky with a random grab)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arcade mode, survival mode and time attack mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ten stages plus the classic grid (duh) and an extra <strong>green screen stage for photobashing shenanigans</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >local versus (online modes unfortunately not planned)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tutorial and training mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a psychopathic dabbing killer robot reinstalled into a bunny droid body (which is actually canon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a giant kaiju robot with plasma chainsaws and a full screen laser</strong> (which is ALSO canon, if you care about this sort of stuff)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the one and only <strong>Callowman from</strong> <strong>Duels of Fortune</strong> as a special playable guest character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and also <strong>Dana Zane from the visual novel VA-11 Hall-A</strong>, ready to mix drinks and smash lives!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "It's judo on a minefield! Tech the grab or die, in this fast-paced 3D fighting game where every! single! throw! is lethal!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/e6444b45e7a66ef0dfe6250d307871130c81d4cd/header.jpg?t=1777065597", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/b6f6f1e175f7c1405ce40085058084c1efc4f63b/caps